<!--
  NOT SHIPPED — Candidate A, "banded capsule" (issue #49).

  A single rounded-capsule silhouette (the CSMU housing) in a neutral light
  fill, centered in the 66dp guaranteed-safe zone, with one inset orange band
  as the sole saturated accent. The band is cut out of the capsule itself
  (evenOdd hole) with a thin transparent groove on each side, so the band
  reads as a distinct raised shape even when this layer is flattened to a
  single tint for the monochrome/themed-icon state — it does not depend on
  the hue surviving.

  Kept as the documented fallback: it survives 48dp/72dp slightly more
  cleanly than the shipped Candidate B, but the repo owner judged that B
  reads as the intended subject (a flight recorder) where A reads only as
  a legible abstract shape (a capsule/battery/toggle) — see
  docs/design/icon/README.md for the full comparison. Candidate B ships as
  app/src/main/res/drawable/ic_launcher_foreground.xml.
-->
